<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SABVEST PROPOSES A RESTRUCTURING OF GROUP.</title>
<headline>SABVEST PROPOSES A RESTRUCTURING OF GROUP.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sabvest Ltd on Thursday said it was planning to acquire the issued shares of Sabhold group and the issued shares and debentures of Merhold Investment Corporation in a restructuring of the group.</p>
<p>The move will result in the delisting of Sabhold and Merhold. The plan is subject to certain conditions precedent including the approval of shareholders and the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company said it would publish a further announcement setting out salient dates of the plan.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
